        "AbstractText": "Withdrawal syndrome is a well known diagnostic entity. As the symptomatology related to this syndrome is extremely unspecific, care must be taken not to ignore withdrawal syndrome, the consequences of which, while rare, can lead to often long and complicated hospitalisations."
